{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2021-03-09 14:04:00', 'title': 'GULFSTREAM AWARDED $696 MILLION IN CONTRACTS FOR U.S. AIR FORCE SPECIAL MISSIONS SUPPORT', 'text': 'SAVANNAH, GA., MARCH 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GULFSTREAM AEROSPACE CORP., A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE:GD), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED $696 MILLION IN CONTRACTS FROM THE U.S. AIR FORCE LIFE CYCLE MANAGEMENT CENTER FOR ENGINEERING SERVICES SUPPORT AND CONTRACTOR LOGISTICS FOR C-20 AND C-37 AIRCRAFT.'}